From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Harfouche <mark.harfouche@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 May 2026 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Restore system protobuf/grpc wiring for TF 2.21.0

Restore the system_build_file/system_link_files wiring for protobuf and
grpc that TF 2.21.0 dropped, adding shim rule files under
third_party/systemlibs (including protobuf_python.bzl as python/BUILD for
pybind11_protobuf) and teaching the grpc stub the plugin_flags argument.
---
